      "\"Good morning, old mother,\" Aurora says politely. \"What are you doing?\"",
      "\"I am spinning wool, my child,\" the old woman says, smiling.",
      "\"What is that funny thing that jumps up and down?\" Aurora asks. She is very curious. She wants to try it. \"Can I spin, too?\"",
